// The smallest useful model: a person, a system with two parts, an outside system,
// the relationships between them, and one view. Everything else is optional.

model notes: Team notes

reader: Team member [person]

notes: Team notes | Shared notes for a small team [system]
  app: Notes app | Where notes are written and read [service]
  db: Notes database | Every note and its history [store]

search: Search provider | Finds notes by their words [external]

reader writes notes in app
app saves notes in db
app sends new notes to search
app asks for matching notes from search

view big-picture: Big picture
  show reader, notes +1, search
